508	     * city already contains between {@link #CAPACITY_WARNING_THRESHOLD} and {@code CITY_CAPACITY - 1}
509	     * owners (inclusive), indicating the city is approaching its capacity limit. Cities are compared
510	     * case-insensitively with surrounding whitespace trimmed. The count reflects the state before the
511	     * new owner is persisted, so it excludes the owner being created.
