745	     * Counts the existing owners that share the owner-to-be's first and last name, compared
746	     * case-insensitively (surrounding whitespace trimmed). The count reflects the state before the
747	     * new owner is persisted, so it excludes the owner being created.
748	     *
749	     * @param firstName the first name of the owner being created
750	     * @param lastName the last name of the owner being created
751	     * @return the number of existing owners with the same first and last name
752	     */
